Package: infinitefactor
Title: Bayesian Factor Analysis with Infinite Factor Priors
Version: 2.0.0.9000
Authors@R: c(
    person("Eduardo", "Vasquez", email = "eduardo.vasqueztapia@duke.edu", role = c("aut", "cre")),
    person("Evan", "Poworoznek", email = "infinitefactorpackage@gmail.com", role = c("aut")),
    person("Nico", "Anceschi", role = c("auth")))
Description: Sampler and post-processing functions for semi-parametric
    Bayesian infinite factor models. Implements different priors for the factor
    loadings such as MGPS, Row-wise and Column-wise Dirichlet-Laplace, CUSP,
    SIS and CMR (TODO: include references). Post-processing functions include 
    the MatchAlign algorithm, which returns identifiable factor loadings through
    succesive application of orthogonalization procedures and resolution of 
    column label and sign switching (TODO: include reference).
